│ Tobacco smoking remains one of the few preventable factors associated with complications in pregnancy, and has       │
│ serious long‐term implications for women and babies. Smoking in pregnancy is decreasing in high‐income countries,    │
│ but is strongly associated with poverty and is increasing in low‐ to middle‐income countries.                        │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Review objective:                                                                                                    │
│ To assess the effects of smoking cessation interventions during pregnancy on smoking behaviour and perinatal health  │
│ outcomes.                                                                                                            │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ Selection criteria:                                                                                                  │
│ Randomised controlled trials, cluster‐randomised trials, and quasi‐randomised controlled trials of psychosocial      │
│ smoking cessation interventions during pregnancy.                                                                    │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ CRITICAL REQUIREMENTS:                                                                                               │
│ 1. Return your decisions as a JSON array where each element is an object with 'study_index' and 'decision' fields.   │
│ 2. The 'decision' field MUST be exactly 'INCLUDE' or 'EXCLUDE' (uppercase).                                          │
│ 3. EVERY study in the chunk must have a decision - no empty values allowed.                                          │
│ 4. You will receive 100 studies (indices 101-200) and must return exactly 100 decisions.                             │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ You will receive a JSON payload containing the studies to screen.                                                    │
