│ and divergence among and between providers and patients about presentation, use of components, and program impact.   │
│ Findings were used to refine the intervention to enhance patient and staff receptivity, specifically to ensure       │
│ participant comprehension and shorten time required of busy staff."}, {"study_index": 299, "title": "Improving the   │
│ delivery of prenatal care and outcomes of pregnancy: a randomized trial of nurse home visitation", "abstract": "We   │
