the voucher program. Total mean voucher earnings across antepartum and postpartum were 397 US dollars (SD=414 US        
dollars) and 313 US dollars (SD=142 dollars) in the contingent and noncontingent conditions, respectively. The magnitude
of these treatment effects exceed levels typically observed with pregnant and recently postpartum smokers, and the      
maintenance of effects through 24 weeks postpartum extends the duration beyond those reported previously."},            
