  388, 389, 390, 391, 392, 393, 394, 395, 396, 397, 398, 399, 400], "studies": [{"study_index": 301, "title": "A        
  descriptive model of the cigarette epidemic in developed countries", "abstract": "It has been estimated that          
  cigarettes are the cause of the deaths of one in two of their persistent users, and that approximately half a         
