│ smoking cessation during pregnancy have not been established, no definitive recommendations can be made on the       │
│ topic. Effectiveness trials have shown that nicotine replacement therapy (NRT) enhances smoking cessation during     │
│ pregnancy, but efficacy trials have not shown an advantage for NRT compared with placebo treatment. Small sample     │
│ size or poor medication compliance (with either the dose or the duration of treatment) may contribute to lack of     │
